    "active": true,
    "description": "<p>SAVE SOUL UNLIVING-LICH</p>\n<p>The necromancy in your hand can still the body with a scholar's precision.</p>\n<p>When your Bony Hand attack inflicts a critical injury, the target must attempt a Fortitude save. On a failure, it is paralysed for 1 round. On a fumble, it is paralysed for 1 minute and falls prone. On a blunder, it is paralysed permanently and falls prone. The saving throw is Hard (DC +2) if the critical injury is Serious and Very Hard (DC +5) if the critical injury is Deadly.</p>\n<p>Works automatically: a critical injury with Bony Hand makes the target save (Fortitude, your Level DC; +2 for a Serious injury, +5 for a Deadly one) — Failure paralysed 1 round; Fumble paralysed 1 minute and prone; Blunder paralysed permanently and prone.</p>",
